# Case 17 of sf1_plc_v4.script, the whole case, optimised: the program's lines verbatim except the
# transfer segments S1-S3 of the rotation sequence, which are generated movej (the program's a and v,
# r=0). The robot enters the case where the previous case left it. Points: SF1_Rotation_17.urscript.
# Simulation passed != safe on the robot: run it at reduced speed first.
# Before the rotation sequence (verbatim from the program)
movej(get_inverse_kin(load_hower_p, qnear=load_hower_q), a=0.17453292519943295, v=0.17453292519943295)
